I picked **sre** because Scaleway is a European cloud provider (Kubernetes Kapsule, and Cockpit, its monitoring service, built on Loki), and its careers page says Engineering owns reliability and scalability. Flags: Cockpit is also built on Grafana, Mimir and Tempo, which Hsan hasn't used, so the CV shows Prometheus/Loki only; Scaleway's Terraform, PostgreSQL and Spark products were left out; the careers page lists no technical internships (only Sales ones in Paris); there's no contact name, so the mail opens with "Hello,".
